                        <summary>
                            
                            <p>The details of the date are given as Viḷambi, Mēsha, śu. 11, Monday corresponding to A.D. 1538, April 8. The <hi rend="italic">tithi</hi> was śu. 10. This records an endowment made by the king of half of the village Vanpākkam with its annual income of 40 <hi rend="italic">poṉ</hi> left as <hi rend="italic">poliyūṭṭu-ubayam</hi> with one Muḍumbai Veṅkappar of Īchchambāḍi for meeting the daily expenses of an offering to god Tiruppanaṅgāvuḍaiya-Nāyanār Anbuḍaiya-Nāyanār.</p>						
                            
                        </summary>
